<h3>What is BMI?</h3>

Body Mass Index is a value derived from your weight and height. It gives a
quick indication of whether your weight sits in a healthy range for your
height, and is widely used as a first-pass screening measure.

<h3>How it is calculated</h3>

BMI is your weight in kilograms divided by the square of your height in
metres.

